3. Changes to the Plugin API

Later versions of RazorFX may change the Plugin API; its version number (major.minor,
razorfx.plugin_api.API_VERSION) signals compatibility. A plugin is an Independent Plugin
with respect to each version of RazorFX whose Plugin API it uses as documented for that
version.


